<!-- Endospore launcher icon (DIA-20260622-01): the same dispersing-spore motif as the shared FP3 icon,
     but in neutral GRAY instead of the Nowhere teal, to fit the GrapheneOS dark theme on the Pixel.
     Overlaid onto core/chooser/res/drawable/ic_nowhere.xml by stage-vendor (editions/endospore/vendor
     rsyncs over vendor/endospore/chooser after the core chooser). Used as the app + Profile/Log-off icon.

     ⚠ THIS is the file that ships on tegu/frankel/lynx/stallion/husky — it OVERRIDES the core drawable, so a
     geometry change made only in core is invisible on every Endospore device. Keep the two in step; they
     differ in COLOUR only.

     DIA-20260816-22: glyph enlarged to match core (x1.150 about its own bbox centre, then recentred on the
     disc) so the bounding box fills 75% of the 100-unit disc on its larger dimension — 72% x 75%, furthest
     dot edge at 43.6 = 87% of the radius. Was 62% x 65%, which next to Clock and the other platform icons
     (~75% glyph / 25% margin) read as a small mark adrift on a large disc. -->
